y: United States","Participating Countries: 24","Final: Brazil 🏆 vs Italy","Date: 17 Jul 1994"],"id":"520","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 1994","year":"1994"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup held in France.","details":["Host Country: France","Participating Countries: 32","Final: France 🏆 vs Brazil","Date: 12 Jul 1998"],"id":"521","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 1998","year":"1998"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup held in South Korea & Japan.","details":["Host Country: South Korea & Japan","Participating Countries: 32","Final: Brazil 🏆 vs Germany","Date: 30 Jun 2002"],"id":"522","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 2002","year":"2002"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup held in Germany.","details":["Host Country: Germany","Participating Countries: 32","Final: Italy 🏆 vs France","Date: 09 Jul 2006"],"id":"523","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 2006","year":"2006"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup held in South Africa.","details":["Host Country: South Africa","Participating Countries: 32","Final: Spain 🏆 vs Netherlands","Date: 11 Jul 2010"],"id":"524","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 2010","year":"2010"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup held in Brazil.","details":["Host Country: Brazil","Participating Countries: 32","Final: Germany 🏆 vs Argentina","Date: 13 Jul 2014"],"id":"525","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 2014","year":"2014"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup held in Russia.","details":["Host Country: Russia","Participating Countries: 32","Final: France 🏆 vs Croatia","Date: 15 Jul 2018"],"id":"526","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 2018","year":"2018"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup held in Qatar.","details":["Host Country: Qatar","Participating Countries: 32","Final: Argentina 🏆 vs France","Date: 18 Dec 2022"],"id":"527","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 2022","year":"2022"},{"description":"The FIFA World Cup co-hosted by Canada, Mexico, and the United States.","details":["Host Country: Canada, Mexico & United States","Participating Countries: 48","Final: Spain 🏆 vs Argentina","Date: 19 Jul 2026"],"id":"1623","side":"positive","timeline_id":"25","title":"FIFA World Cup 2026","year":"2026"},{"description":"Parag Agrawal was born in Ajmer, Rajasthan, India, to a father who worked in the Department of Atomic Energy and a mother who was an Economics professor.","details":null,"id":"649","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Born in Ajmer, Rajasthan","year":"21 May 1984"},{"description":"After completing his schooling at Atomic Energy Central School, Agrawal won a gold medal at the International Physics Olympiad held in Antalya, Turkey.","details":null,"id":"650","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Physics Olympiad gold medal","year":"2001"},{"description":"Agrawal earned his BTech in Computer Science and Engineering from IIT Bombay and moved to the United States to pursue a PhD at Stanford University.","details":null,"id":"651","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"BTech from IIT Bombay","year":"2005"},{"description":"While pursuing his doctorate at Stanford under Professor Jennifer Widom, Agrawal worked as a researcher and intern at Microsoft, Yahoo, and AT&T Labs.","details":null,"id":"652","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Industry internships","year":"2007"},{"description":"Agrawal joined Twitter as a software engineer while still completing his PhD, starting on the company's advertising engineering team.","details":null,"id":"653","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Joins Twitter","year":"2011"},{"description":"Agrawal completed his PhD in computer science at Stanford with a thesis titled \"Incorporating Uncertainty in Data Management and Integration.\"","details":null,"id":"654","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Completes Stanford PhD","year":"2012"},{"description":"Agrawal's work on machine learning and advertising and consumer engineering contributed to a re-acceleration of Twitter's audience growth, making him the company's first Distinguished Engineer.","details":null,"id":"655","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Distinguished Engineer","year":"2016"},{"description":"Agrawal was named Chief Technology Officer of Twitter, taking responsibility for the company's technical strategy and its use of machine learning across the platform.","details":null,"id":"656","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Appointed Chief Technology Officer","year":"Oct 2017"},{"description":"As CTO, Agrawal was given responsibility by Jack Dorsey to find a leader for Bluesky, Twitter's research initiative into decentralized social media standards.","details":null,"id":"657","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Tasked with leading Bluesky search","year":"Dec 2019"},{"description":"Agrawal's search concluded with the selection of Jay Graber to lead the Bluesky project, which later spun out as an independent company.","details":null,"id":"658","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Jay Graber named to lead Bluesky","year":"Aug 2021"},{"description":"Following Jack Dorsey's surprise resignation, Agrawal was named CEO of Twitter at age 37, becoming the youngest CEO in the S&P 500 at the time.","details":null,"id":"659","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Named CEO of Twitter","year":"29 Nov 2021"},{"description":"Agrawal took several weeks of paternity leave shortly after becoming CEO, a decision that was publicly praised as a positive example for working fathers.","details":null,"id":"660","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Paternity leave as new father","year":"Feb 2022"},{"description":"Under Agrawal's leadership, Twitter's board agreed to Elon Musk's proposal to acquire the company for approximately $44 billion.","details":null,"id":"661","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Twitter board accepts Musk's buyout offer","year":"25 Apr 2022"},{"description":"Elon Musk publicly mocked an internal memo Agrawal had written explaining Twitter's content moderation philosophy, escalating tension between the two ahead of the acquisition's completion.","details":null,"id":"662","side":"negative","timeline_id":"30","title":"Public friction with Musk","year":"May 2022"},{"description":"After Musk attempted to terminate the acquisition agreement, Twitter, led by Agrawal, sued Musk in Delaware Chancery Court to force him to complete the deal.","details":null,"id":"663","side":"negative","timeline_id":"30","title":"Twitter sues to enforce merger","year":"12 Jul 2022"},{"description":"Former Twitter security chief Peiter \"Mudge\" Zatko testified before the US Congress with allegations of security and privacy failures at the company during Agrawal's tenure.","details":null,"id":"664","side":"negative","timeline_id":"30","title":"Zatko whistleblower testimony","year":"13 Sep 2022"},{"description":"Immediately after completing his $44 billion acquisition of Twitter, Elon Musk fired Agrawal along with other top executives including CFO Ned Segal and legal chief Vijaya Gadde.","details":null,"id":"665","side":"negative","timeline_id":"30","title":"Fired as Twitter CEO","year":"27 Oct 2022"},{"description":"Agrawal founded Parallel Web Systems, an AI infrastructure startup building tools to let AI agents search and interact with the web at scale.","details":null,"id":"666","side":"positive","timeline_id":"30","title":"Founds Parallel Web Systems","year":"2023"},{"description":"Agrawal and three other fired Twitter executives filed a lawsuit against Musk and X Corp alleging they were owed a combined $128 million in unpaid severance.","details":null,"id":"667","side":"negative","timeline_id":"30","title":"Files severance lawsuit against Musk","year":"Mar 2024"},{"description":"Agrawal's severance lawsuit against Musk and X Corp was disclo