":"140","title":"Studied at Zilla Parishad school","year":"Childhood"},{"description":"Moved to Aurangabad, now officially Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar, for college education.","details":null,"id":"4070","side":"positive","timeline_id":"140","title":"Moved to Aurangabad","year":"1990s"},{"description":"Completed a bachelor's degree in History from Government College of Arts and Science in Aurangabad.","details":null,"id":"4071","side":"positive","timeline_id":"140","title":"Earned History degree","year":"1996"},{"description":"Began postgraduate study in Political Science at Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Marathwada University, Aurangabad.","details":null,"id":"4072","side":"positive","timeline_id":"140","title":"Started political science master's","year":"1996"},{"description":"Publicly listed professional records identify him with UGC-JRF-level academic qualification in Political Science.","details":null,"id":"4074","side":"positive","timeline_id":"140","title":"Qualified for UGC research","year":"1998"},{"description":"Did not clear his first reported attempt at the Union Public Service Commission Civil Services Examination.","details":null,"id":"4075","side":"negative","timeline_id":"140","title":"Faced initial UPSC setback","year":"2003"},{"description":"Cleared the UPSC Civil Services Examination with All India Rank 20.","details":null,"id":"4076","side":"positive","timeline_id":"140","title":"Cleared UPSC examination","year":"2004"},{"description":"Joined the Indian Administrative Service as a 2005-batch officer of the Maharashtra cadre.","details":null,"id":"4077","side":"positive","timeline_id":"140","title":"Joined Maharashtra IAS cadre","year":"2005"},{"description":"Underwent civil-service training at the Lal Bahadur Shastri National Academy of Administration in Mussoorie.","details":null,"id":"4078","side":"positive","timeline_id":"140","title":"Trained at LBSNAA","year":"2005"},{"description":"Began his field career as a trainee deputy collector and assistant col